('Band glute bridge','Glutes','Resistance band','Beginner. Band above the knees, lift the hips and push the knees out against the band.',409),
('Band hip thrust','Glutes','Resistance band','Intermediate. Upper back on a bench, band above the knees, drive the hips up and push the knees out.',410),
('Band clamshell','Glutes','Resistance band','Beginner. Lie on your side with the band above the knees, open the top knee and lower slowly.',411),
('Band glute kickback','Glutes','Resistance band','Beginner. On hands and knees with the band under one foot, press the leg back and return slowly.',412),
('Band lateral walk','Glutes','Resistance band','Beginner. Band above the knees, small knees-bent steps sideways keeping tension on the band.',413),
('Band monster walk','Glutes','Resistance band','Intermediate. Band around the ankles, walk forward and back with wide steps and a slight squat.',414),
