('Band woodchop','Core','Resistance band','Intermediate. Band anchored high, pull it diagonally down across the body, rotating through the trunk.',416),
('Band good morning','Lower back','Resistance band','Beginner. Stand on the band with it over the shoulders, hinge at the hips with a flat back and stand tall.',417),
('Band thruster','Full body','Resistance band','Intermediate. Stand on the band, squat, then stand and press the hands overhead in one movement.',418),
