('Wide push-up','Chest','Bodyweight','Beginner. Hands wider than shoulders, lower the chest to the floor and press up.',419),
('Pause push-up','Chest','Bodyweight','Intermediate. Lower to just above the floor, pause for two seconds, then press up.',420),
